# Model weight files are large binaries — do not commit them to git.
# Fetch them with `npm run fetch-models` (see scripts/fetch-models.mjs) or
# place your own exported files here. See public/models/README.md.
*.onnx
*.task
*.bin
# TFJS model shards
group*-shard*
# But keep this directory tracked and its docs.
!.gitignore
!README.md
